TEXT -72 -312 Left 2 !.func fn_v(f) 1 - f + f*ln(f)/6\n.func get_f(E) pwr(q, 3)/(4*pi*epsilon1*pwr(phi, 2))*E\n.func ifn(A, a, b, phi, vc, d, g) -1E-15*A*a*square(7*g*Efield(vc*1E+12, d))/phi*exp(-b*pwr(phi, 2/3)/(7*g*Efield(vc*1E+12, d))*fn_v(get_f(7*g*Efield(vc*1E+12, d))))\n.func Efield(v,d) abs(max(v/d, 0))\n.func is(A, alph, T, phi, vc, d, g) -1E-15*A*alph*square(T)*exp(min((-phi +0.5*sqrt((g*Efield(vc*1E+12, d)/(d*3.14*0.055263))/(0.8617u*T)), 0)))
